00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:36,360
I summon Melkid the Four-Faced Beast.

251
00:13:36,740 --> 00:13:40,217
Then I sacrifice Revival
Jam and Melkid the

252
00:13:40,300 --> 00:13:43,860
Four-Faced Beast to
summon the Masked Beast,

253
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:45,040
Discordius.

254
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:48,560
That is one powerful monster.

255
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:50,840
Now attack my Masked Beast.

256
00:13:51,220 --> 00:13:53,160
Destroy her Dark Witch.

257
00:13:53,760 --> 00:13:54,590
Wrong!

258
00:13:55,220 --> 00:13:59,640
