261
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:14,400
Ka-blan!

262
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:17,640
Marix lost even more life points. Hold on.

263
00:14:17,980 --> 00:14:19,920
It's not time to celebrate yet.

264
00:14:20,700 --> 00:14:21,820
Dark Witch!

265
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:24,420
When it's destroyed,

266
