Okay, Merrick, you may have gotten
a few lucky shots, but that's over.

282
00:15:11,280 --> 00:15:12,737
Things are about to change.

283
00:15:12,820 --> 00:15:13,650
Indeed.

284
00:15:13,733 --> 00:15:15,260
Much more than you know.

285
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:16,477
What does that mean?

286
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:19,897
And what's up with that creepy smile
