All of you will.

294
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:32,708
You just don't know it yet.

295
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:36,920
Now listen to me, foolish girl.

296
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:40,117
I'm afraid that practice time is over,

297
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:45,240
