302
00:15:59,580 --> 00:16:00,900
What's with this fog?

303
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:02,866
This is not part of the game.

304
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:04,740
What have you done, Merrick?

305
00:16:07,640 --> 00:16:09,660
Welcome to the Heart of Darkness.

306
00:16:10,060 --> 00:16:11,354
It's just as I feared.

307
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:14,457
Merrick has summoned the evil
powers of the Shadow Realm.

308
00:16:14,540 --> 00:16:15,780
Of the Shadow what?

309
00:16:16,040 --> 00:16:18,275
It just looks like we flew into a fog.

310
00:16:18,540 --> 00:16:20,700
This is no ordinary fog.

311
00:16:21,040 --> 00:16:22,720
I remember this place.

312
00:16:23,160 --> 00:16:26,817
So they've experienced the
dangers of this realm before.

313
00:16:26,900 --> 00:16:29,780
Well, this time there will be no escaping.

314
00:16:30,220 --> 00:16:31,960
Merrick, end this now!

315
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:33,430
Never!

316
00:16:33,620 --> 00:16:36,380
The shadows are hungry,
and they will be fed.

317
00:16:36,780 --> 00:16:41,800
If little Mai wants to continue this
match, she'll have to do so in my world,

318
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:45,980
a world where there's much more
to lose than just a simple duel.

319
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:49,400
Mai, this duel must end now!

320
00:16:49,580 --> 00:16:51,698
There's more at stake than you know!

321
00:16:52,100 --> 00:16:53,300
Forfeit the match!

322
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:56,137
Yugi, have you completely lost it?

323
00:16:56,220 --> 00:16:57,960
I've worked hard for this.

324
00:16:58,140 --> 00:17:01,537
It'll take a lot more than some
creepy fog to scare me off.

325
00:17:01,620 --> 00:17:07,300
So if you'll excuse me, I've got a
duel to win. My! Listen, Yugi, Joey,

326
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:09,840
everyone, I appreciate your concerns,

327
00:17:09,980 --> 00:17:13,840
but my mind's made up and I'm
going to stay in this duel.

328
00:17:14,040 --> 00:17:16,020
And nothing can change that.

329
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:17,900
Very good, foolish girl.

330
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:20,577
I knew that I could
count on you to use that

331
00:17:20,660 --> 00:17:24,517
stubborn mind of yours while
you still remember how.

332
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:26,600
Well then, that's that.

333
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:28,757
If there's one thing about mine,

334
00:17:28,840 --> 00:17:32,428
once the girl makes up her mind,
there's no way to unmake it.

335
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:33,470
That's true.

336
00:17:33,660 --> 00:17:35,900
This time it might cost her. Big.

337
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:37,900
You ready, Merrick?

338
00:17:39,060 --> 00:17:41,320
I'm always ready for a shadow game.

339
00:17:41,540 --> 00:17:43,577
I hope mine knows what she's up against.

340
00:17:43,660 --> 00:17:47,097
All the rules of the game as she
knows them are about to change.

341
00:17:47,180 --> 00:17:48,100
All right.

342
00:17:48,560 --> 00:17:49,417
Here I go.

343
00:17:49,500 --> 00:17:55,500
I place one card face down, and
I summon the unfriendly Amazon.

344
00:17:57,800 --> 00:17:59,420
Why is she glowing?

345
00:18:00,740 --> 00:18:01,780
Confused, Mai?

346
00:18:01,980 --> 00:18:05,420
The energy that surrounds your
Amazon is a symbol of you,

347
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:07,740
or your mind to be more precise.

348
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:11,980
If it goes out, so will
a portion of your mind.

349
00:18:12,420 --> 00:18:14,937
This is the nature of the Shadow Realm.

350
00:18:15,020 --> 00:18:16,180
Don't worry.

351
00:18:16,480 --> 00:18:21,304
You'll understand it much better once
you've experienced my dark magic first hand.

352
00:18:21,600 --> 00:18:26,071
Oh, how I love watching someone feel
these shadow powers for the first time.

353
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:32,240
There is something very wrong with
this guy, but I can't get distracted.

354
00:18:32,660 --> 00:18:37,900
Now, my unfriendly Amazons, attack
the Dark Witch with Soaring Clash!

355
00:18:41,100 --> 00:18:42,080
Very good.

356
