360
00:18:54,060 --> 00:18:55,360
You see, Mai,

361
00:18:55,620 --> 00:18:58,397
each monster we play on
the field carries with

362
00:18:58,480 --> 00:19:01,600
it the memory of a person
we hold within our mind.

363
00:19:01,740 --> 00:19:03,820
So when a monster is destroyed,

364
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:07,717
the memory of a person from
your life is destroyed with it.

365
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:08,682
There's no way!

366
00:19:09,220 --> 00:19:10,050
Say, what?

367
00:19:10,133 --> 00:19:12,296
What on earth is Marek talking about?

368
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:14,637
That psycho's gotta be out of his gourd!

369
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:16,397
There's no way he's telling the truth.

370
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:20,892
Now let's see which one of your friends
will become your first lost memory.

371
00:19:21,260 --> 00:19:22,240
Not Taya?

372
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:25,402
Yes, and now she'll be
banished from your memory.

373
00:19:26,040 --> 00:19:27,760
