375
00:19:33,220 --> 00:19:34,050
Impossible?

376
00:19:34,133 --> 00:19:36,260
Nothing's impossible in the Shadow Realm.

377
00:19:36,560 --> 00:19:39,207
Why do you think I
brought you here, my dear?

378
00:19:39,380 --> 00:19:42,977
For I'm controlling this
kingdom of infinite blackness.

379
00:19:43,060 --> 00:19:45,080
And by the time I'm through,

380
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:49,282
you'll be a mindless shell all
alone in a world full of strangers.

381
00:19:52,580 --> 00:19:58,800
Can you feel them drifting slowly away
from you, disappearing into the light,

382
00:19:59,120 --> 00:20:03,620
fading from the chasms of your
mind, the wells of your heart?

383
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:05,840
Wait, come back, please!

384
00:20:06,500 --> 00:20:07,960
No, this can't be!

385
00:20:08,220 --> 00:20:10,397
Now, now, don't worry, my dear.

386
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:16,877
you're only losing one of them
for now I can't see her that's

387
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:22,300
right now Taya's nothing more
than a faceless phantom to you

388
00:20:22,860 --> 00:20:28,977
my memory is growing faint
yo my are you okay my oh

389
00:20:29,060 --> 00:20:33,917
you're far from okay I'm afraid
this is just the beginning

390
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:37,897
for behind each dark corner
the shadow realm holds

391
00:20:37,980 --> 00:20:41,560
another frightening twist
like an eternal nightmare.

392
00:20:42,260 --> 00:20:44,380
Only this is quite real.
